          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Since BX = 4 cm, and the radius of the circle centred at B is 5 cm, it is clear that the circles will intersect each other at two points."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 2,
